    {
      "id": "p0088-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "One of the most important concepts in Undertale is known as \"determination''. At first, the use of this word doesn't seem particularly noteworthy, but its sig11ificance grows as the game progresses. The word also carries several extra meanings unique to Undertale, so Toby naturally left many notes about it.",
        "raw": "One of the most important concepts in Undertale is known as \"determination''.\nAt first, the use of this word doesn't seem particularly noteworthy, but its\nsig11ificance grows as the game progresses. The word also carries several extra\nmeanings unique to Undertale, so Toby naturally left many notes about it.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28939907,
          0.24640714,
          0.89555051,
          0.31463571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28736234,
          0.24569286,
          0.9055916,
          0.31570714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          17,
          18,
          19,
          20
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 中最重要的概念之一叫作 determination（决心）。起初，这个词的使用似乎没什么特别，但随着游戏推进，它的重要性越来越明显。这个词在 Undertale 中还包含几层独特的含义，因此 Toby 自然为它留下了大量笔记。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 90,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
