    {
      "id": "p0088-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This left one last question: how do you differentiate between general ketsui and Undertale-style ketsui in the Japanese script? The solution, which Toby also suggested, was to use eye-catching katakana for Undertale \"determination\", and ordinary hiragana for more general determination.",
        "raw": "This left one last question: how do you differentiate between general ketsui and\nUndertale-style ketsui in the Japanese script? The solution, which Toby also\nsuggested, was to use eye-catching katakana for Undertale \"determination\",\nand ordinary hiragana for more general determination.",
        "status": "corrected",
